[node name="IntroPanelPrefab" type="MarginContainer"]
editor_description = "ATTENTION

This is meant to be used as a kind of prefab for making variants of the Intro Panel. 
It has to have the same format as IntroPanelDefault:
- a Control scene root
-- This scene as a child

Then, right-click this scene and enable \"Editable Children\" to make changes.
That way, anything you have not manually changed about this scene will be propagated to your variant if this scene itself is changed."
